| [`AppDbContext.cs`](file:///c:/Repos/URL-Shortener/src/UrlShortener.Infrastructure/Persistence/AppDbContext.cs) | EF Core DbContext — Fluent API config, unique index on `ShortCode`, index on `ClickEvent.ShortCode` |
