| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [`ClickEventChannel.cs`](file:///c:/Repos/URL-Shortener/src/UrlShortener.Infrastructure/Analytics/ClickEventChannel.cs) | Bounded `Channel<ClickEvent>` — 10K capacity, `DropOldest`, `SingleReader=true` |
