## Smoke Test Instructions

```powershell
# Start the API
dotnet run --project src/UrlShortener.Api

# In another terminal:
# 1. Create a short URL
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/urls -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"url": "https://github.com"}'

# 2. Follow the redirect (use -v to see 302)
curl -v http://localhost:5000/{shortCode}

# 3. Check analytics (click count should increment)
curl http://localhost:5000/api/v1/urls/{shortCode}/analytics
```

Or open **Swagger UI** at `http://localhost:5000/swagger` to test interactively.
